OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds join TT rider's widow for
OL,4,Amemorial lap
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of bikers, marshals and
OL,7,Fmembers of the public have joined TT
OL,8,Frider Daniel Ingham's widow as she
OL,9,Fcompleted a memorial lap of the Isle of
OL,10,FMan course, to "finish the lap he never
OL,11,Fgot to."
OL,13,FIngham, 33, died after crashing on the
OL,14,Fopening lap of a TT qualifying session
OL,15,Fon 27 May.
OL,17,FHelayna Ingham said the last few months
OL,18,Fhad been "heartbreaking", but she and
OL,19,Fher two children had been carried by
OL,20,Fthe support of "the incredible racing
OL,21,Fcommunity".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,448,445,260,140,0,100
